[[!:https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/40a0a47432b4e8c857d40152295f1551702c1012.png]]((Listen up, Crumbums! Your King is here. announcement art))

Out of the sewers and into the streets, the rightful King of the Rats is here at last. Rodent-hating citizens of Manhattan won't be prepared to see his __Scrap Grenade__ bouncing down Broadway, nor for his __Swarm of Rats__ biting at their heels. By donning his __Royal Pestments__, the Rat King shakes off incoming damage, allowing him to bravely lead the charge into battle. His loyal subjects will feel awed and inspired when they see the great __Banner of Rattania__ waving in the middle of combat, and those who oppose him will rue the day they ever thought they could overthrow the king. - __"Oh the rats are taking over, baby!"__

The Rat King is available to play now! Have a great weekend and keep those votes coming, as our next hero will be joining us on Tuesday at 2pm PDT. We'll see you then!